## Risk Assessment

✅ Low: The change is display-only and opt-in: the default chat digest keeps its bounded title and reason, `--fields gate-text` is explicitly opt-in and adds full text to every gate, the CSS change applies only to Charted Next rows, and the updated secondmate-summary test matches the newly untruncated queued fields.

